<p class="eyebrow">Services · Professional Services</p>
<h1>Professional Services</h1>
<p class="lead">Consulting-led work for teams that need cloud, containers and compliance done properly — by specialists, with a clear plan and a clear handover. In plain English: the heavy technical work, handled by people who do it every day. Technically: cloud landing zones, managed Kubernetes and OpenShift, AI, and compliance readiness — we help you get compliant, we do not certify you.</p>
<p style="max-width:760px"><strong>What am I selling here?</strong> If you run real infrastructure, need compliance evidence, or need specialists, start here. If you need a website, start with Website Services. If you need hosting that works, start with Managed Hosting.</p>
<div class="grid3"><div class="card silo"><h3>Cloud & Infrastructure</h3><p class="plain">Cloud that scales without drama.</p><p class="tech">Cloud is not a server in someone else's building.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/cloud-infrastructure"}>Explore Cloud & Infrastructure →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Managed Kubernetes</h3><p class="plain">Kubernetes, run for you.</p><p class="tech">Kubernetes is the standard way to run containerised applications at scale — and the standard way to spend your team's time babysitting clusters.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/kubernetes"}>Explore Managed Kubernetes →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Managed OpenShift</h3><p class="plain">OpenShift, managed end to end.</p><p class="tech">OpenShift is Red Hat's enterprise Kubernetes platform — Kubernetes, with the guardrails, pipelines and security that regulated and larger teams need, built in.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/openshift"}>Explore Managed OpenShift →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Managed Container Hosting</h3><p class="plain">Containers, hosted and managed.</p><p class="tech">Containers are how modern applications are shipped: the application and everything it needs, in one package that runs the same everywhere.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/managed-containers"}>Explore Managed Container Hosting →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Compliance Readiness</h3><p class="plain">Compliant by design — not certified by us.</p><p class="tech">Compliance readiness means your cloud and your processes are set up so you can pass an audit for HIPAA, PCI DSS or SOC 2 — and prove it.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/compliance-readiness"}>Explore Compliance Readiness →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>AI Consulting</h3><p class="plain">AI that saves time, not headlines.</p><p class="tech">Practical AI is not a chatbot on your homepage.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/ai-consulting"}>Explore AI Consulting →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Technology Consultancy</h3><p class="plain">A clear plan before you spend.</p><p class="tech">Technology consultancy is independent advice, before you spend money.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/consultancy"}>Explore Technology Consultancy →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Design & Developer Staffing</h3><p class="plain">Extra hands, when you need them.</p><p class="tech">Sometimes you do not need a project, you need a person.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/staffing"}>Explore Design & Developer Staffing →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Talent Marketplace</h3><p class="plain">Vetted talent, on demand.</p><p class="tech">A talent marketplace is a pool of vetted designers, developers and strategists you can draw on, project by project, without hiring.</p><a href={BASE + "/services/talent-marketplace"}>Explore Talent Marketplace →</a></div></div>
<h2 style="margin-top:40px">How to choose</h2>
<p style="max-width:760px">Start with the service that matches your problem, not with the whole list. Every service below has its own page — what it is, who it is for, what you get, how it works, what it costs, and the questions people ask before they buy. If you are not sure which one, book a strategy call and we will point you to the right one before you commit to anything.</p>
<h2 style="margin-top:40px">What it costs</h2>
<p style="max-width:760px">Every project is quoted, and we scope before we quote. Tell us your budget and we tell you what fits, in writing, before you commit. No fixed price list, no hidden fees.</p>
<h2 style="margin-top:40px">Before you ask</h2>
<div class="faq"><details><summary>Do you certify us for HIPAA or PCI DSS?</summary><p style="margin-top:10px">No — and no vendor can. Your auditor certifies you, after reviewing evidence. We build the systems and prepare the evidence so you can pass.</p></details>
<details><summary>What is the difference between an ongoing service and a project?</summary><p style="margin-top:10px">Ongoing services are monthly: somebody is responsible on a Tuesday afternoon when nothing is on fire. Projects have a beginning and an end, and are scoped and priced as projects. Staffing is a third thing: a person, for a fixed period.</p></details>
<details><summary>Who owns the cloud account and the code?</summary><p style="margin-top:10px">You do. The account, the code and the documentation are yours, in your name. We manage them; we do not own them.</p></details>
<details><summary>How do we start?</summary><p style="margin-top:10px">With a strategy call. We review what you have, what it must do, and what it costs — then we give you a plan in writing, before you commit.</p></details></div>
<p style="margin-top:32px"><a class="btn" href={BASE + "/contact"}>Contact us →</a></p>
</div></section>
